member.summary:

READ:GPRF:MEASurement<Instance>:FFTSanalyzer:PEAKs:AVERage
            Returns the results of the peak search. Separate commands retrieve current and average values. There are results for search range no. 0 to 4: &lt;Reliability&gt;, &lt;Frequency0&gt;, &lt;Power0&gt;, ..., &lt;Frequency4&gt;, &lt;Power4&gt;

For return value see the help for ResultData structure arguments


